  "description": "Using the library's classes, it is possible to create Aggregate, Entity, and ValueObject classes. These classes can be validated using Fluent Validation to ensure that all domain properties are in a valid state. For simple ValueObjects with a single value, ScalarValueObject can be used. If the only requirement for a ValueObject is that the value is not null or empty, RequiredString can be utilized.",
